     The ccssqqrrtt(), ccssqqrrttff(), and ccssqqrrttll() functions conform to ISO/IEC
     9899:1999 (“ISO C99”).

BBUUGGSS
     For ccssqqrrtt() and ccssqqrrttll(), inexact results are not always correctly
     rounded.

